BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 607.0 Tm (requires COUNT\(DISTINCT \(a, b\)\) on a row constructor.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 577.5 Tm (Best Practices) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 552.3 Tm (- Prefer COUNT\(*\) for "how many rows"; it states intent and never surprises.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 539.2 Tm (- Decide explicitly whether NULL means zero or means unknown, then encode that decision with) Tj ET
