BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 238.4 Tm (Question) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 213.2 Tm (How do you pivot rows into columns in standard SQL - for example, order counts per status as) Tj ET
