BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 105.0 Tm (Best Practices) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 79.8 Tm (- Rule: **join conditions and filters on the outer table go in ON; filters on the preserved) Tj ET
