BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 728.0 Tm (That ordering has one critical consequence: **you cannot filter on a window function in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 714.5 Tm (WHERE.** Wrap the query in a subquery or CTE and filter outside. This is the number one) Tj ET
