BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 464.9 Tm (orders, 9 of them never scanned - accumulated from years of one-off reports. Each insert was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 451.4 Tm (maintaining all 14. Dropping the unused ones cut p99 insert latency from 40ms to 9ms without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 437.9 Tm (touching a single query.) Tj ET
