BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 633.2 Tm (  // $1/$2 are bound as VALUES; the string "' OR '1'='1" is just a string) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 623.2 Tm (  return \(await pool.query\(sql, [email, passwordHash]\)\).rows;) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 613.2 Tm (}) Tj ET
