BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 471.8 Tm (Common Mistakes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 446.6 Tm (- Thinking a deadlock hangs forever - the detector resolves it in about a second by default.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 433.5 Tm (- Blaming isolation level. Deadlocks occur at every isolation level.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 420.4 Tm (- Retrying the victim immediately with no backoff, causing a retry storm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 407.3 Tm (- Holding locks across an external HTTP call inside a transaction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 394.2 Tm (- Confusing a deadlock \(cycle, auto-resolved\) with lock contention \(slow, not resolved\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 365.1 Tm (Best Practices) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 339.9 Tm (- Codify a lock-ordering rule in the team's coding standard - "always by ascending primary key".) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 326.8 Tm (- Bounded retry with jitter on 40P01 and 40001.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 313.7 Tm (- SKIP LOCKED for job queues; NOWAIT when the caller can fail fast.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 300.6 Tm (- Set deadlock_timeout and log deadlocks; treat a rising rate as a design smell.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 287.5 Tm (- Batch operations in a consistent order - sort ids before the loop.) Tj ET
