BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 325.0 Tm (    PARTITION BY HASH \(tenant_id\);) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 315.0 Tm (CREATE TABLE events_p0 PARTITION OF events_p FOR VALUES WITH \(MODULUS 4, REMAINDER 0\);) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 305.0 Tm (CREATE TABLE events_p1 PARTITION OF events_p FOR VALUES WITH \(MODULUS 4, REMAINDER 1\);) Tj ET
