BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 728.0 Tm (- Not marking pure functions IMMUTABLE/STABLE, blocking optimisation and expression indexes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 698.9 Tm (Best Practices) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 673.7 Tm (- Triggers for audit trails and invariants; application code for business workflow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 660.6 Tm (- Keep trigger bodies short and side-effect-free; enqueue work instead of doing it inline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 647.5 Tm (- Use AFTER UPDATE OF column to narrow firing conditions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 634.4 Tm (- Mark function volatility correctly and always SET search_path in SECURITY DEFINER) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 621.3 Tm (functions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 607.8 Tm (- Document every trigger in the schema README - they are invisible at the call site.) Tj ET
