BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 553.5 Tm (1. BEFORE versus AFTER triggers - which can modify NEW?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 540.4 Tm (2. What are IMMUTABLE, STABLE and VOLATILE and what do they enable?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 527.3 Tm (3. How do you prevent infinite trigger recursion?) Tj ET
