BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Common Mistakes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 691.8 Tm (- Saying MongoDB "has no schema" - it has no enforced schema by default, but every application) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 678.7 Tm (has an implicit one, and $jsonSchema can enforce it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 665.2 Tm (- Claiming MongoDB cannot do transactions or joins. Both exist \($lookup, multi-document ACID\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 652.1 Tm (- Embedding unbounded arrays and hitting the 16 MB ceiling in production.) Tj ET
