BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 384.6 Tm (Difficulty: Hard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 371.1 Tm (Category: MongoDB -> Replica sets, transactions) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 341.6 Tm (Question) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 316.4 Tm (Explain replica sets, write concern and read preference. When do you need multi-document) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 302.9 Tm (transactions?) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 273.4 Tm (Answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 248.2 Tm (A replica set is a group of mongod nodes holding the same data: one primary accepting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 234.7 Tm (writes, several secondaries replicating the oplog. If the primary fails, the members hold an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 221.2 Tm (election \(Raft-like\) and a secondary is promoted, typically within 10 to 12 seconds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 202.7 Tm (Write concern w controls how many nodes must acknowledge a write:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 179.2 Tm (Setting        Meaning                         Risk) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 168.9 Tm (---------------------------------------------------) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 158.7 Tm (w: 0           fire and forget                 data loss, no error reporting) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 148.4 Tm (w: 1           primary only                    lost on primary failure before replication) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 138.2 Tm (w: "majority"  majority of voting members      durable across failover - the default since 5.0) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 127.9 Tm (j: true        flushed to the journal on disk  survives process crash) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 105.7 Tm (Read preference controls which node serves reads: primary \(default, strongly consistent\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 92.2 Tm (primaryPreferred, secondary, secondaryPreferred, nearest. Reading from secondaries scales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 78.7 Tm (reads but gives you eventual consistency - replication lag means you can read stale data,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 276.9 32 Tm 0.45 g (Page 86 of 160) Tj ET 0 g
