BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Real-world Scenario) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691.8 Tm (A payments service wrote with the default w: 1 on an older driver. During a routine primary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 678.3 Tm (failover, roughly 40 acknowledged payment records that had not yet replicated were lost, while) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 664.8 Tm (the payment gateway had already charged the cards. Switching to w: "majority", j: true plus a) Tj ET
