0.6 w 0.65 G 54 626.8 m 558 626.8 l S 0 G
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 594.8 Tm (MERN Q5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 562.5 Tm (Difficulty: Easy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 549.0 Tm (Category: Express -> Middleware) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 519.5 Tm (Question) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 494.3 Tm (What is middleware in Express? Explain the execution order and the role of next\(\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 464.8 Tm (Answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 439.6 Tm (Middleware is a function \(req, res, next\) that sits in an ordered chain. Each one can read and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 426.1 Tm (mutate req/res, end the response, or call next\(\) to pass control on. Express matches) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 412.6 Tm (middleware top to bottom in registration order - order is behaviour, not style.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 394.1 Tm (Four kinds:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 375.6 Tm (1. Application-level - app.use\(fn\), runs for every request.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 362.6 Tm (2. Router-level - router.use\(fn\), scoped to a mount path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 349.5 Tm (3. Route-level - app.get\(path, mw1, mw2, handler\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 336.4 Tm (4. Error-handling - four arguments \(err, req, res, next\). Express identifies it by arity, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 323.3 Tm (you must declare all four parameters even if you ignore next.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 304.8 Tm (Rules that matter:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 286.3 Tm (- Failing to call next\(\) and not responding leaves the request hanging until timeout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 273.2 Tm (- Calling next\(err\) skips all remaining normal middleware and jumps to the error handler.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 260.1 Tm (- Error handlers must be registered last, after all routes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 247.0 Tm (- In Express 4, a thrown error inside an async handler is not caught automatically - you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 233.9 Tm (must wrap it. Express 5 forwards rejected promises to the error handler.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 204.4 Tm (Example) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 179.2 Tm (A request pipeline: request id, logging, body parsing, authentication, the route, then the 404) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 165.7 Tm (and error handlers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 136.2 Tm (Code Example) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 106.0 Tm (import express from "express";) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 96.0 Tm (import { randomUUID } from "node:crypto";) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 78.6 Tm (const app = express\(\);) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 276.9 32 Tm 0.45 g (Page 89 of 160) Tj ET 0 g
endstream
