BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 678.0 Tm (}\);) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 660.6 Tm (// 2. structured request logging with duration measured on finish) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 650.6 Tm (app.use\(\(req, res, next\) => {) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 640.6 Tm (  const start = process.hrtime.bigint\(\);) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 630.6 Tm (  res.on\("finish", \(\) => {) Tj ET
