BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 428.4 Tm (                          { issuer: "shop-api", audience: "shop-web" }\);) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 418.4 Tm (    next\(\);) Tj ET
