BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Real-world Scenario) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691.8 Tm (A startup issued 30-day JWTs stored in localStorage. A third-party analytics script was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 678.3 Tm (compromised and exfiltrated tokens from thousands of browsers. Because the tokens were stateless) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 664.8 Tm (and long-lived, the only remedy was rotating the signing secret, which logged out every user and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 651.3 Tm (broke mobile clients that had no refresh flow. The rebuild used 15-minute access tokens and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 637.8 Tm (rotating refresh cookies.) Tj ET
