BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 163.4 Tm (    items.push\({ id: Date.now\(\), name: "Keyboard", qty: 1 }\);) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 153.3 Tm (    setItems\(items\);) Tj ET
