BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Best Practices) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 691.8 Tm (- Let the linter enforce the full dependency array; fix the design rather than silencing it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 678.7 Tm (- Always return cleanup for anything subscribed, timed or in flight.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 665.6 Tm (- Use a data library \(TanStack Query, SWR, or the framework loader\) for fetching - it handles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 652.5 Tm (caching, dedupe, retries and races for you.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 639.0 Tm (- Do not use effects to sync state that can be derived during render.) Tj ET
