BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691.8 Tm (Escalate only when the current tool hurts:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 673.3 Tm (1. Local useState - state used by one component or passed one level.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 660.2 Tm (2. Lifted state / composition - shared by a few siblings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 647.1 Tm (3. Context - low-frequency global values: theme, locale, current user, feature flags.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 634.0 Tm (4. Server-state library \(TanStack Query, SWR, RTK Query\) - anything that comes from an API.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 620.9 Tm (This eliminates most of what teams historically put in Redux.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 607.4 Tm (5. Redux Toolkit / Zustand / Jotai - genuinely global, frequently updated client state with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 594.3 Tm (complex transitions, or when you need time-travel debugging and middleware.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 575.8 Tm (The Context trap: every consumer of a context re-renders when the context value changes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 562.3 Tm (regardless of which part of the value it uses. A single context holding user, theme, cart and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 548.8 Tm (notifications re-renders the entire tree on any cart change. Mitigations: split into several) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 535.3 Tm (narrow contexts, memoise the provider value, or use a store with selector-based subscriptions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 516.8 Tm (The modern default for a MERN app: TanStack Query or RTK Query for server data, Context for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 503.3 Tm (handful of static globals, and a small store only if genuinely needed.) Tj ET
