BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 249.0 Tm (   +------------------------------+) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 239.0 Tm (   |  pending callbacks  some system errors) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 229.0 Tm (   +------------------------------+) Tj ET
