BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 344.7 Tm (Declarations are processed before code executes. var is hoisted to the top of its function) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 331.2 Tm (scope and initialised to undefined. let and const are hoisted to the top of their block) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 317.7 Tm (but left uninitialised - reading them before the declaration throws, and that window is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 304.2 Tm (Temporal Dead Zone \(TDZ\). Function declarations are fully hoisted; function expressions are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 290.7 Tm (not.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 267.2 Tm (                    var        let        const) Tj ET
