BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 226.2 Tm (Reassign            yes        yes        no) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 215.9 Tm (Before declaration  undefined  TDZ error  TDZ error) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 205.7 Tm (On globalThis       yes        no         no) Tj ET
