BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Real-world Scenario) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691.8 Tm (A single-page app registered a resize handler per route that closed over the rendered dataset.) Tj ET
