BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 397.3 Tm (results are discarded, so unhandled rejections can still surface. Use AbortController for real) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 383.8 Tm (cancellation.) Tj ET
