BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 383.1 Tm (Principle              Statement                              Smell it prevents) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 372.9 Tm (-------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 362.6 Tm (Single Responsibility  a class has one reason to change       god classes) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 352.4 Tm (Open/Closed            open to extension, closed to modific~  editing a switch for every new case) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 342.1 Tm (Liskov Substitution    a subtype must be usable wherever th~  subclass throwing on inherited methods) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 331.9 Tm (Interface Segregation  many small interfaces beat one fat o~  implementing methods you must stub out) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 321.6 Tm (Dependency Inversion   depend on abstractions, not concreti~  untestable code welded to a driver) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 299.4 Tm (The most-violated is Liskov: the classic Square extends Rectangle breaks callers that set width) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 285.9 Tm (and height independently. Penguin extends Bird with fly\(\) throwing is the same error.) Tj ET
