BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 691.8 Tm (- Size thread pools near core count for CPU-bound work; higher for I/O-bound.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 678.7 Tm (- Prefer immutable data or message passing over shared mutable state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 665.6 Tm (- Use processes when isolation matters \(untrusted plugins, crash containment\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 652.5 Tm (- Watch involuntary context switches as a saturation signal.) Tj ET
