BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 92.9 Tm (    postmortem myself rather than waiting to be asked.") Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 75.5 Tm (R  "Eleven minutes of failed checkouts, roughly 400 orders. What I changed: I rewrote it as) Tj ET
