BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 485.0 Tm (whether) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 471.5 Tm (you are safe to trust with production. Candidates who cannot name a failure are usually either) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 458.0 Tm (inexperienced or not reflective.) Tj ET
